    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707680/extras/f814dc07c6d027063d575abab743b1cb.poster.avif?t=1729086827\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707680/extras/f814dc07c6d027063d575abab743b1cb.webm?t=1729086827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707680/extras/f814dc07c6d027063d575abab743b1cb.mp4?t=1729086827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Most people think that the work of a soccer referee on the field is an easy task. In our new production, you can see how it really is. <br>Because it is up to the referee how the whole spectacle will look like.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707680/extras/481ba339b3098ec26e02e0032203dab6.poster.avif?t=1729086827\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707680/extras/481ba339b3098ec26e02e0032203dab6.webm?t=1729086827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707680/extras/481ba339b3098ec26e02e0032203dab6.mp4?t=1729086827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>It is the referee who decides how much players can push themselves giving them warnings or cards, or even turning a blind eye to minor infractions. On this depends the charisma of the referee and the respect with which the players treat him.<br>And the more mistakes they make, the more time they spend when watching VAR replays or consulting the other referees, the less respect the players have for him and the more they allow themselves.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707680/extras/6101c1d98be9f4e8ec9f9918dac7b40c.poster.avif?t=1729086827\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707680/extras/6101c1d98be9f4e8ec9f9918dac7b40c.webm?t=1729086827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707680/extras/6101c1d98be9f4e8ec9f9918dac7b40c.mp4?t=1729086827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>A good referee must also strategically spread his strength over the whole game to avoid a situation where the action is happening beyond his reach. You can take a moment to relax with constant parts of the game or browsing the VAR, but this will not help to regenerate strength.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707680/extras/780288baba8c8dbde54c915b339f124f.poster.avif?t=1729086827\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707680/extras/780288baba8c8dbde54c915b339f124f.webm?t=1729086827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707680/extras/780288baba8c8dbde54c915b339f124f.mp4?t=1729086827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Obvious errors in the assessment of the situation, apart from the fact that after each match, the referee\u2019s work is assessed by the referee commission, cause brawls on the pitch and very stressful disapproval of the audience. And in stress, it is easier to make further mistakes.<br><br>Start with league matches to referee increasingly serious matches, and finally be the main referee at the World Cup!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Features:<br></li><li>interacting with all aspects of the match<br></li><li>simulates the referee\u2019s fatigue, charisma and stress<br></li><li>advanced player AI<br></li><li>action replays with smooth slow motion<br></li><li>match statistics<br></li><li>a referee\u2019s career<br></li><li>advanced AI of the audience behavior</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707680/extras/f814dc07c6d027063d575abab743b1cb.poster.avif?t=1729086827\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707680/extras/f814dc07c6d027063d575abab743b1cb.webm?t=1729086827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707680/extras/f814dc07c6d027063d575abab743b1cb.mp4?t=1729086827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Most people think that the work of a soccer referee on the field is an easy task. In our new production, you can see how it really is. <br>Because it is up to the referee how the whole spectacle will look like.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707680/extras/481ba339b3098ec26e02e0032203dab6.poster.avif?t=1729086827\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707680/extras/481ba339b3098ec26e02e0032203dab6.webm?t=1729086827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707680/extras/481ba339b3098ec26e02e0032203dab6.mp4?t=1729086827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>It is the referee who decides how much players can push themselves giving them warnings or cards, or even turning a blind eye to minor infractions. On this depends the charisma of the referee and the respect with which the players treat him.<br>And the more mistakes they make, the more time they spend when watching VAR replays or consulting the other referees, the less respect the players have for him and the more they allow themselves.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707680/extras/6101c1d98be9f4e8ec9f9918dac7b40c.poster.avif?t=1729086827\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707680/extras/6101c1d98be9f4e8ec9f9918dac7b40c.webm?t=1729086827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707680/extras/6101c1d98be9f4e8ec9f9918dac7b40c.mp4?t=1729086827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>A good referee must also strategically spread his strength over the whole game to avoid a situation where the action is happening beyond his reach. You can take a moment to relax with constant parts of the game or browsing the VAR, but this will not help to regenerate strength.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707680/extras/780288baba8c8dbde54c915b339f124f.poster.avif?t=1729086827\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707680/extras/780288baba8c8dbde54c915b339f124f.webm?t=1729086827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1707680/extras/780288baba8c8dbde54c915b339f124f.mp4?t=1729086827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Obvious errors in the assessment of the situation, apart from the fact that after each match, the referee\u2019s work is assessed by the referee commission, cause brawls on the pitch and very stressful disapproval of the audience. And in stress, it is easier to make further mistakes.<br><br>Start with league matches to referee increasingly serious matches, and finally be the main referee at the World Cup!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Features:<br></li><li>interacting with all aspects of the match<br></li><li>simulates the referee\u2019s fatigue, charisma and stress<br></li><li>advanced player AI<br></li><li>action replays with smooth slow motion<br></li><li>match statistics<br></li><li>a referee\u2019s career<br></li><li>advanced AI of the audience behavior</li></ul>",
